y commander... will have frozen this entire square."},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Don't make me die for nothing."},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_219_meteo_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Amiya... We can't... I won't leave her!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7","name2":"char_219_meteo_1#3","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I understand."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I won't leave Frostleaf behind."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I will not... leave anyone behind!"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I'll hold off the enemy squads' movements."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Meteorite... I'm counting on you to bring Frostleaf back!!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7","name2":"char_219_meteo_1#3","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Meteorite","text":"Roger!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor! Please lead our squads!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7","focus":-1}},{"t":"decision","options":["Way ahead of you!","(Nod)","Affirmative!"],"values":["1","2","3"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1","2","3"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"initr":2,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Now that I think about it..."},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"I've only used these Arts once before."},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"'Wherever there is blood...'"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":1,"g":1,"b":1,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"Hah."},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"So you want to use your ice... to counter mine?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"Nnh...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"How will you do that if you can't even use your tongue anymore?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_193_frostl_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Frostleaf","text":"You..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"Yeti Squadron, spread out."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1002_nsabr_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"Roger."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1505_frstar_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"My brethren..."},{"t":"line","name":"FrostNova","text":"Flush them out, and freeze their blood."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1002_nsabr_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"Understood."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"'...Your mind can hide nothing from me.'"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1002_nsabr_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"An incantation?"},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"The rabbit of Rhodes Island..."},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"Black... lines? ...What the hell is that?"},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"Wh-what kind of Arts is that--"},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":